    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community</h1><p><br><strong>Be part</strong> of the development and join the community.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Unlock, equip, upgrade and survive... -</strong></h2>Slay thousands of enemies with auto-attacking unique weapons, using the help of different elements and their powerful element reaction attacks or with many mighty so called wandering souls. Collect blessings to upgrade your weapons and implants to strenghten your character.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977090/extras/1db13bf8a87433630dd0d39b5c6309e5.poster.avif?t=1733824728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977090/extras/1db13bf8a87433630dd0d39b5c6309e5.webm?t=1733824728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977090/extras/1db13bf8a87433630dd0d39b5c6309e5.mp4?t=1733824728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You gain experience and become stronger the longer you survive. Exactly what you need to defeat the incoming challenging boss after 20min of survival. But the arriving Soul Lord is just a minion of the ruler of chaos, the Soul King.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay/Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose your <strong>Soul Slayer</strong> and use his unique active ability wisely.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock and pick different <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>wandering souls</strong>.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Empower specific wandering souls to powerful <strong>master souls</strong>.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your souls, weapons and <strong>implants</strong> to strenghten your character.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enhance your weapons with different elements for strong <strong>element reaction attacks</strong>, which can also trigger further reactions.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own unique <strong>build</strong>.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survive mode: Survive 20min and defeat thousands of enemies and one of many <strong>bosses</strong> called Soul Lord's. If you succeed you are going to encounter the Soul King, the ruler of Chaos.</li></ul><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Unlock, equip, upgrade and survive... -</strong></h2>Slay thousands of enemies with auto-attacking unique weapons, using the help of different elements and their powerful element reaction attacks or with many mighty so called wandering souls. Collect blessings to upgrade your weapons and implants to strenghten your character.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977090/extras/1db13bf8a87433630dd0d39b5c6309e5.poster.avif?t=1733824728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977090/extras/1db13bf8a87433630dd0d39b5c6309e5.webm?t=1733824728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977090/extras/1db13bf8a87433630dd0d39b5c6309e5.mp4?t=1733824728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You gain experience and become stronger the longer you survive. Exactly what you need to defeat the incoming challenging boss after 20min of survival. But the arriving Soul Lord is just a minion of the ruler of chaos, the Soul King.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay/Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose your <strong>Soul Slayer</strong> and use his unique active ability wisely.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock and pick different <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>wandering souls</strong>.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Empower specific wandering souls to powerful <strong>master souls</strong>.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your souls, weapons and <strong>implants</strong> to strenghten your character.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enhance your weapons with different elements for strong <strong>element reaction attacks</strong>, which can also trigger further reactions.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own unique <strong>build</strong>.</